        {
          "text": " Mwanadamu, watu hawa wametwaa vinyago vyao na kuvitia mioyoni mwao, nao wameweka kwazo la uovu wao mbele ya nyuso zao. Je! Nitakubali kuombwa ushauri na wao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
