            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sema nao, uwaambie, Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Kila mtu wa nyumba ya Israeli atwaaye vinyago vyake na kuvitia moyoni mwake, na kuliweka kwazo la uovu wake mbele ya uso wake, na kumwendea nabii; mimi, BWANA, nitamjibu neno lake kulingana na wingi wa sanamu zake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
